ide tracking field name'=>'如果你想让你的追踪标签保存在单独的字段中，请提供追踪字段的名称','If you would like to convert your youtube video to a file, try <a href="https://www.clipconverter.cc/2/" target="_blank">clipconverter</a> <br> To convert from .mp4 to webM format, try <a href="https://convertio.co/de/mp4-webm/" target="_blank">convertio</a> <br> You may also use <a href="https://handbrake.fr/" target="_blank">handbrake</a> to convert your file formats and also reduce the file size.<br><strong>Benefits</strong>: Load video faster, reduce space and bandwidth needed on server'=>'如果您想将您的youtube视频转换为文件，请尝试<a href="https://www.clipconverter.cc/2/" target="_blank">clipconverter</a> <br> 要从.mp4转换为webM格式，请尝试<a href="https://convertio.co/de/mp4-webm/" target="_blank">convertio</a> <br> 您也可以使用<a href="https://handbrake.fr/" target="_blank">handbrake</a>来转换文件格式，同时减少文件大小。<br><strong>好处</strong>。加载视频更快，减少服务器上的空间和带宽需求','If your host let you upload small sized videos only, install free %1$sTuxedo Big File Uploads%2$s plugin and use the "multi file upload link inside the add new media screen, to upload as big files as you like.'=>'如果你的主机只允许你上传小尺寸的视频，请安装免费的%sTuxedo Big File Uploads%s插件，并使用 "添加新媒体屏幕内的多文件上传链接，以上传你喜欢的大文件。','Iframe'=>'Iframe','Iframe makes sense when you are sharing a stream like a virtual expo room, or a continues space view transmission. Why make sense? Because when user reload the page the stream continued in the background.'=>'Iframe在你分享像虚拟展览室这样的流媒体时是有意义的，或继续空间视图传输。为什么有意义？因为当用户重新加载页面时，流媒体在后台继续。','Import'=>'进口','Import Campaign'=>'进口活动','Import Leads (CSV)'=>'导入信息（CSV）','Import Leads Into This Campaign'=>'将信息导入此活动中','Import Leads Now'=>'现在进口信息','Important update for %s license holders!'=>'针对 %s 许可证持有者的重要更新！','Imprint'=>'版本说明','In Free version: Evergreen webinars have limited registrations up to %1$s per %2$s days.'=>'在免费版本中。常青网络研讨会的注册人数有限，每 %s 天最多可注册 %s 次。','In Free version: You can create unlimited Live webinars with unlimited registrations, but with old webinar room design.'=>'在免费版本中。你可以创