h'=>'为默认 CTA 部分设置最大宽度。CTA 将填满宽度，在较小的屏幕上显示会更小。如果要设置 CTA 60% 宽度，则留空或设置为 0','Set maximum width for default CTA section. Left blank or set 0 if you want to set CTA 100% width'=>'设置默认CTA部分的最大宽度。留空或设置0，如果你想设置CTA 100%的宽度。','Set maximum width for default CTA section. Left blank or set 0 if you want to set CTA 60% width'=>'设置默认 CTA 部分的最大宽度。如果要设置 CTA 60% 宽度，则留空或设置为 0','Set the delay time (in seconds) before redirection, defaults to "0" seconds which means no delay'=>'设置重定向前的延迟时间（秒），默认为 "0 "秒，意味着没有延迟','Set the maximum width in % or px for this CTA. Leave blank or set to 0 if you want the CTA to be 60% wide.'=>'设置此 CTA 的最大宽度（单位：%或 px）。如果希望 CTA 的宽度为 60%，则留空或设置为 0。','Set up an URL where visitor should be redirected if they try to visit protected webinar or lead id with public ids. By defaulr they will be redirected to home page.'=>'设置一个URL，如果访问者试图访问受保护的网络研讨会或公共ID的线索ID，他们应该被重定向。默认情况下，他们将被重定向到主页。','Set your Publishable Key: remember to change this to your Live Publishable Key in production. Get your keys here https://dashboard.stripe.com/account/apikeys'=>'设置你的可发布密钥：记得在生产中把它改为你的实时可发布密钥。在这里获得你的密钥 https://dashboard.stripe.com/account/apikeys','Set your Secret Key: remember to change this to your Live Secret Key in production. Get your keys here https://dashboard.stripe.com/account/apikeys'=>'设置你的秘钥：记得在生产中把它改成你的实时秘钥。在这里获得你的密钥 https://dashboard.stripe.com/account/apikeys','Settings'=>'设置','Settings Dashboard'=>'设置控制面板','Settings for customising live console'=>'用于定制实时控制台的设置','Settings for the CTA to appear on the automated webinar page. Can either be shown from the start OR based on a time in the video...'=>'设置自动网络研讨会页面上出现的CTA。可以从一开始就显示，也可以根据视频中的某个时间显示...','Settings for timed actions, ending redirect and CTA popup...'=>'为定时行动、结束重定向和CTA弹出式设置...','Settings for when the replay expires...'=>'设置重播到期的时间...','Settings for your console Q&A'=>'为你的控制台设置问答','Settings for your question system - built-in or 3rd party integration...'=>'为你的提问系统设置--内置或第三方集成...','Setup for the video that is played on th