>'注册电子邮件测试','Signup To The Webinar'=>'注册参加网络研讨会','Simple Q/A'=>'简单的问与答','Simply share the webinar on any of the social networks above, and you will get instant access to this reporcss..'=>'只需在上述任何一个社交网络上分享该网络研讨会，您就可以立即获得该报告。','Single Lead'=>'单一导线','Site Description'=>'现场描述','Site Title'=>'网站标题','Skip Confirmation'=>'跳过确认','Skip Thank you page'=>'跳过谢谢你的页面','Skip Thank you page for future date webinars'=>'跳过感谢页面，查看未来日期的网络研讨会','Skip Thank you page for Instant Access webinars'=>'跳过即时访问网络研讨会的感谢页面','Slider'=>'滑块','SMS has been sent.'=>'短信已发送。','SMS Reminder section with headlines'=>'带有标题的短信提醒部分','SMTP Connection Test Failed.'=>'SMTP连接测试失败。','SMTP Connection Test Successful!'=>'SMTP连接测试成功!','SMTP error: '=>'SMTP错误。','SMTP Host'=>'SMTP主机','SMTP Password'=>'SMTP密码','SMTP Port'=>'SMTP端口','SMTP Settings'=>'SMTP设置','SMTP Username'=>'SMTP用户名','Social Share Image URL'=>'社会分享图片URL','Solution & Support'=>'解决方案和支持','Solution Center'=>'解决方案中心','Some licenses got unlimited activations/keys. If you run out of keys,'=>'一些许可证有无限的激活/密钥。如果你的钥匙用完了、','Something went wrong'=>'出了问题','Something went wrong, please try again later'=>'出错了，请稍后再试','Specify by how many days to delay the available registration date, based when the user visited the registration page.'=>'根据用户访问注册页面的时间，指定将可用的注册日期推迟多少天。','Specify how many dates to make available. Defaults to 7. Maximum is also 7.'=>'指定有多少个日期可用。默认为7。最大也是7个。','Specify the description for the charge. This is all that is needed. You need not edit the values in the fields below Button Color field.'=>'指定收费的描述。这就是所需的全部内容。你不需要编辑按钮颜色字段下面的字段的值。','Specify the email address to which the registration notifications should be sent'=>'指定应发送注册通知的电子邮件地址','Specify the email address to which the test email should be sent'=>'指定发送测试邮件的电子邮件地址','Specify the number of days to postpone the first available registration date. During this period, the Registration page will remain accessible, but the options in the date dropdown will adjust according to your specified delay.'=>'指定推迟首个