ou Page URL'=>'谢谢你的页面URL','Thank You URL'=>'谢谢你的网址','Thanks! You should receive a confirmation email for <b>WebinarIgnition</b> to your mailbox at %s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to complete the opt-in.'=>'谢谢！您的邮箱 %s 应该会收到 <b>WebinarIgnition</b> 的确认电子邮件。请确保点击邮件中的按钮完成选择加入。','Thanks! You will get a reminder before the webinar...'=>'谢谢!在网络研讨会之前，你会收到一个提醒...','The amount of time the auto replay is available for. Default its open for 3 days after the event. To disable replay, make it specify 00.<br/><strong>Disabling the replay will prevent Instant Webinar Access. Only disable the replay, if you are not using the instant access feature.</strong>'=>'自动回放的可用时间。默认情况下，它的开放时间为事件发生后的3天。<br/><strong>禁用重播将阻止即时网络研讨会访问。如果您不使用即时访问功能，只能禁用回放。','The answer to your question:'=>'你的问题的答案。','The background image (repeating) and the banner image should have the size height, so it looks good on the site, any size will work, but best is around 89px high...'=>'背景图片（重复）和横幅图片应该有一定的高度，所以在网站上看起来不错，任何尺寸都可以，但最好是89px左右的高度。','The core CTA area, which can be a video or an image...'=>'核心的CTA区域，可以是一个视频或一个图像。','The core settings for your webinar event...'=>'你的网络研讨会活动的核心设置...','The custom video url must be in .mp4 format as the player uses a html5 video player...'=>'自定义视频 URL 必须是 .mp4 格式，因为播放器使用的是 html5 视频播放器...','The date format depends on the format you have chosen in WordPress\'s General Settings page.'=>'日期格式取决于你在WordPress的常规设置页面中选择的格式。','The file is also attached to this email for your convenience.'=>'该文件也附在这封电子邮件中，以方便您的使用。','The headline that appears over the optin area...'=>'出现在选择区上方的标题...','The main landing page copy that appears under the CTA video / image area...'=>'出现在CTA视频/图片区域下的主要登陆页面副本...','The media could not be loaded, either because the server or network failed or because the format is not supported.'=>'无法加载媒体，要么是因为服务器或网络故障，要么是因为不支持该格式。','The media is encrypted and we do not have the keys to decrypt it.'=>'该媒体是加密的，我们没有解密的钥匙。','The Most Powerful Webinar Platform for Live &amp; Automated Webinars'=>'最强大的网络研讨会平台，用于现场和amp; 自动网络研讨会','The MP4 file that you want to play as your automated webinar... must be in .mp4 format as its uses a html5 video player...'=>'你想作为自动网络研讨会播放的MP4文件...必须是.mp4格式，因为它使用的是html5视频播放器...','The MP4 file that you want to play as your CTA... must be in .mp4 format as its uses a html5 video player...'=>'你想作为CTA播放的MP4文件...必须是.mp4格式，因为它使用的是html5视频播放器...','The Name Of The Host(s)'=>'主持人的名字','The page you are trying to delete is used for one of your webinars, you need to delete the webinar first.'=>'您要删除的页面用于您的一个网络研讨会，您需要先删除网络研讨会。','The previews above are for the Thank You Page, Webinar & Replay are just previews. They change depending  on the time & date chosen by the lead...'=>'上面的预览是针对感谢页面的，网络研讨会和回放只是预览。它们的变化取决于领导所选择的时间和日期...','The question block will refresh in 15 seconds...'=>'该问题块将在15秒内刷新...','The RAW html form code given to you by your AR service...'=>'你的AR服务给你的RAW格式代码...','The share social messages for the Twitter and Facebook are taken from the webinar event info; Title & Description...'=>'推特和脸书的分享信息取自网络研讨会活动信息；标题和描述...','The share title and description are the landing page META info which can be found in the registration page settings area...'=>'分享的标题和描述是登陆页面的META信息，可以在注册页面设置区找到...','The text to appear in the footer of all WebinarIgnition pages and emails. Available placeholders:'=>'出现在所有WebinarIgnition页面和电子邮件的页脚的文本。可用的占位符。','The text to appear in the footer of all WebinarIgnition pages and emails. Available placeholders: {site_title}, {year}, {imprint}, {privacy_policy}, {site_description}'=>'出现在所有WebinarIgnition页面和电子邮件的页脚的文本。可用的占位符。{site_title}, {year}, {imprint}, {privacy_policy}, {site_description}.','The timed action is in seconds, one second is 1, one minute would be 60, 15 minutes would be 900...'=>'计时动作的单位是秒，一秒钟是1，一分钟会是60，15分钟是900...','The video will auto-resized, but its best you have a video with the same aspect ratio of 500x281...'=>'视频将自动调整大小，但最好有一个长宽比为500x281的视频。','The video will be auto-resized to fit the page at 410x231 - make sure your video is a similiar aspect ratio...'=>'视频将被自动调整大小，以适应410x231的页面 - 确保你的视频是一个类似的长宽比...','The webinar is live in 1 hour!'=>'网络研讨会将在1小时后直播!','The webinar is live...'=>'网络研讨会正在进行中...','The webinar is starting soon! Jump On Live:'=>'网络研讨会即将开始!跳上现场。','The webinar replay is going down soon...'=>'网络研讨会的回放很快就会下来...','The webinar replay is live...'=>'网络研讨会的重播正在进行中...','The webinar URL type, you can either display the webinar link for this webinar OR if you want to use your own live webinar page, you can enter in a custom URL...'=>'网络研讨会的URL类型，你可以显示本次网络研讨会的网络研讨会链接，或者如果你想使用你自己的网络研讨会直播页面，你可以输入一个自定义的URL...','The Webm file that you want to play as your automated webinar... must be in .webm format as its uses a html5 video player.'=>'你想作为自动网络研讨会播放的Webm文件......必须是.webm格式，因为它使用html5视频播放器。','This appears above the main optin area. This should really get people excited for your event, so they really want to be there...'=>'这出现在主要选择区的上方。这应该真的让人们对你的活动感到兴奋，所以他们真的想去那里......','This appears above the thank you area...'=>'这出现在感谢区的上方...','This code can be used to integrate with other landing pages like OptimizePress, ListEruption, etc. <br><br>	When someone enters the form they get added to the webinar here, if you have sendgrid connected, they get an email and added to your sendgrid list. If you have an AR connected, they will also be added to the AR you setup.<br><br><b>** Note: Only <u>NAME & EMAIL</u> Are sent Over ** Your optin code must not require other fields to work properly or this may not work...</b>'=>'这段代码可以用来与其他登陆页面整合，如OptimizePress、ListEruption等。<br><br>当有人进入表格时，他们会被加入到网络研讨会中，如果你有sendgrid连接，他们会收到一封邮件并被加入到你的sendgrid列表中。如果你有一个AR连接，他们也将被添加到你设置的AR中。<br><br><b>**注意：只有<u>名字和EMAIL</u>被发送过来 **你的选择代码必须不要求其他字段正常工作，否则这可能无法工作...</b>。','This color will also be used in the thank you page for the step headlines...'=>'这种颜色也将用于步骤标题的感谢页面中...','This email should be sent out 1 day after the webinar...'=>'这封邮件应该在网络研讨会后1天发出...','This email should be sent out 1 day before the webinar...'=>'这封邮件应在网络研讨会前1天发出...','This email should be sent out 1 hour after the webinar...'=>'这封邮件应该在网络研讨会结束后1小时发送...','This email should be sent out 1 hour before the webinar...'=>'这封邮件应该在网络研讨会召开前1小时发出...','This email should be sent out when the webinar is live...'=>'这封邮件应该在网络研讨会直播时发出...','This feature creates a live webinar experience for your audience.'=>'这一功能为你的听众创造了一个现场网络研讨会的体验。','This is a block for the webinar information, quick snap shot...'=>'这是一个用于网络研讨会信息的区块，快速拍摄...','This is a custom URL you want the button to go on the countdown page...'=>'这是你希望按钮在倒计时页面上的一个自定义URL...','This is a raw optin form that you can use to integrate this webinar with other landing pages / plugins... adv. users'=>'这是一个原始的选择表格，你可以用来将这个网络研讨会与其他登陆页面/插件整合起来......建议用户','This is a reminder that the webinar you signed up for is tomorrow...'=>'这是一个提醒，你报名参加的网络研讨会是在明天...','This is a txt msg that is sent out 1 hour before live...'=>'这是一个在直播前1小时发出的短信...','This is a txt msg that is sent out before live...'=>'这是在直播前发出的Txt msg...','This is also used for the thank you page for the CTA area there...'=>'这也被用于感谢页面的CTA区域。','This is an area for custom CSS code you can add to the page...'=>'这是一个自定义CSS代码的区域，你可以将其添加到页面上...','This is an area for custom JS code you can add to the page, displayed in the HEAD tag...'=>'这是你可以添加到页面的自定义JS代码的区域，在HEAD标签中显示...','This is custom html you can have for the timed area which will show under the replay...'=>'这是你可以为计时区定制的html，它将显示在回放之下。','This is for the for the buttons to add the webinar to their calendars...'=>'这是为了让按钮将网络研讨会添加到他们的日历上...','This is how long your webinar video is... NB: Must be in minutes ie:  60'=>'这是你的网络研讨会视频的长度...注：必须以分钟为单位，即：60','This is how long your webinar video is... NB:Must be in minutes ie:  60'=>'这是你的网络研讨会视频的长度...注：必须以分钟为单位，即：60分钟','This is just a preview. The Real Thank You Page Depends On User Submited Dates - Do a Fake Optin For Real The Experience'=>'这只是一个预览 - 真正的感谢页面取决于用户提交的日期 - 做一个假的选择来获得真实的体验','This is message displayed when the webinar registration is closed.'=>'这是网络研讨会注册结束时显示的信息。','This is shown below the video area, you can have the main bits of what they will learn on the webinar here...'=>'这显示在视频区下面，你可以在这里拥有他们在网络研讨会上所要学习的主要内容......','This is shown next to the date copy, this is a custom Date...'=>'这显示在日期副本的旁边，这是一个自定义的日期...','This is shown next to the host copy, this is a custom host title...'=>'这显示在主机副本旁边，这是一个自定义的主机标题...','This is shown next to the time copy, this is a custom time...'=>'这显示在时间拷贝的旁边，这是一个自定义的时间...','This is shown next to the webinar copy, this is a custom event title...'=>'这显示在网络研讨会副本的旁边，这是一个自定义的事件标题...','This is shown on the right hand side of the page above the webinar date...'=>'这显示在网页右侧的网络研讨会日期上方...','This is shown under the headline above and shows the users local time...'=>'这显示在上面的标题下，并显示用户的当地时间...','This is shown under the headline above, ideal for stating the time of the webinar...'=>'这显示在上面的标题下，非常适合说明网络研讨会的时间...','This is shown under the headline above...'=>'这在上面的标题下显示...','This is shown under the main headline...'=>'这在主标题下显示...','This is the actual number they would need to call to join in on the live call...'=>'这是他们需要拨打的实际号码，以加入现场通话。','This is the area for the webinar URL...'=>'这是网络研讨会URL的区域...','This is the background color for the headline area... Make it a color that stands out on the page. The sales copy headline will always be white, so make sure this color works well with white text...'=>'这是标题区的背景颜色...使其成为一种在页面上突出的颜色。销售文案的标题将始终是白色的，所以要确保这种颜色与白色文本配合得很好...','This is the bit of text below or next to an emailâ€™s subject line in the inbox. Leave empty if you would like to use the header text above instead. '=>'这是收件箱中电子邮件主题行下面或旁边的一段文字。如果你想使用上面的标题文本，请留空。','This is the code for the live chat / QA system you want to use, this code should be provided to you by the 3rd party service...'=>'这是您想使用的即时聊天/QA系统的代码，这个代码应该由第三方服务提供给您...','This is the color for the area around the video...'=>'这是视频周围区域的颜色...','This is the color for the CTA area that video or image 