isplays next to the webinar description...'=>'这是显示在网络研讨会描述旁边的副本...','This is the copy that displays next to the webinar title...'=>'这是显示在网络研讨会标题旁边的副本...','This is the copy that is displayed on the button...'=>'这是显示在按钮上的副本...','This is the copy that is displayed on the order button...'=>'这是显示在订单按钮上的副本...','This is the copy that is displayed when the countdown reaches zero, or when you select webinar closed in the main webinar control...'=>'这是在倒计时达到零时，或在网络研讨会主控制中选择网络研讨会关闭时显示的副本...','This is the copy that is shown above the countdown timer...'=>'这是显示在倒计时器上方的副本...','This is the copy that is shown above the main CTA button...'=>'这是显示在主要CTA按钮上方的副本...','This is the copy that is shown above the sales copy for the landing page, it has a background color to make it pop on the page...'=>'这是显示在着陆页销售文案上方的文案，它有一个背景颜色，使其在页面上突出。','This is the copy that is shown above the sharing / unlock options...'=>'这是在共享/解锁选项上方显示的副本...','This is the copy that is shown after they share on one of the social networks, best to have your download link to the free offer here...'=>'这是他们在某个社交网络上分享后显示的副本，最好在这里有你的免费报价的下载链接...','This is the copy that is shown at the top of page...'=>'这是显示在页面顶部的副本...','This is the copy that is shown next to the call number...'=>'这是显示在呼叫号码旁边的副本...','This is the copy that is shown on the button below the countdown timer...'=>'这是显示在倒数计时器下面的按钮上的副本...','This is the copy that is shown on the button to submit the question'=>'这是在提交问题的按钮上显示的副本','This is the copy that is shown on the button when the countdown is down to zero, and the button links to the webinar...'=>'这是倒计时到零时按钮上显示的副本，按钮链接到网络研讨会...','This is the copy that is shown on the reminder button...'=>'这是在提醒按钮上显示的副本...','This is the copy that is shown on the right of the event ticket area...'=>'这是显示在活动票区右侧的副本...','This is the copy that is shown once they submit their phone number...'=>'这是他们提交电话号码后显示的副本...','This is the copy that is shown under the countdown timer, above the button...'=>'这是显示在倒数计时器下方、按钮上方的副本...','This is the copy that is shown under the share options before they share to unlock the reward...'=>'这是在他们分享解锁奖励之前，在分享选项下显示的副本...','This is the copy that is shown when they submit a question, shows for a 20 seconds, then QA re apears..'=>'这是他们提交问题时显示的副本，显示20秒，然后QA重新出现。','This is the copy the copy shown above the webinar video to invite friends to the webinar (Facebook & Twitter)...'=>'这是网络研讨会视频上方显示的副本，用于邀请朋友参加网络研讨会（Facebook和Twitter）...','This is the csv download link key. Append it to the webinar url to download the questions csv file.'=>'这是csv下载链接键。将它附加到网络研讨会的网址上，以下载问题的csv文件。','This is the custom code for your order button. Can be shortcode.'=>'这是您的订单按钮的自定义代码。可以是短码。','This is the date on which this email is out sent out...'=>'这是该电子邮件发出的日期...','This is the date on which this txt message is out sent out...'=>'这是该txt消息发出的日期...','This is the date the webinar goes down by, after this date, the replay page will be replaced with the closed page...'=>'这是网络研讨会结束的日期，在此日期之后，重播页面将被关闭的页面所取代...','This is the date, you can use the webinar settings, or use custom date...'=>'这是日期，你可以使用网络研讨会的设置，或使用自定义日期...','This is the email address of the additional host member'=>'这是额外主机成员的电子邮件地址','This is the email address of the host staff host_member'=>'这是主办方工作人员的电子邮件地址 host_member','This is the email address of the support staff'=>'这是支持人员的电子邮件地址','This is the email address of the support staff member'=>'这是支持人员的电子邮件地址','This is the email address to send the question notifications to'=>'这是用于发送问题通知的电子邮件地址','This is the email copy that is sent out when they first sign up...'=>'这是他们第一次注册时发出的电子邮件副本...','This is the email subject line...'=>'这就是电子邮件的主题行...','This is the embed code for the live streaming for the webinar, can be Youtube, Vimeo, YouStream, etc...'=>'这是网络研讨会直播的嵌入代码，可以是Youtube、Vimeo、YouStream等。','This is the embed code for the video for the webinar replay...'=>'这是网络研讨会回放视频的嵌入代码...','This is the embed code the live streaming service gives you, it is automatically resized to fit: 920px by 518px...'=>'这是直播服务给你的嵌入代码，它被自动调整为适合：920px by 518px...','This is the heading that is shown above the GDPR fields.'=>'这是显示在GDPR字段上方的标题。','This is the headline above the countdown area for how long the replay is live for...'=>'这是倒计时区上面的标题，说明重播的时间有多长......。','This is the headline area for above the share / social unlock area...'=>'这是在分享/社会解锁区之上的标题区...','This is the headline for the add to calendar area...'=>'这是添加到日历区的标题...','This is the headline text for choosing a date for the webinar...'=>'这是为网络研讨会选择日期的标题文字...','This is the headline text for choosing a time for the webinar...'=>'这是选择网络研讨会时间的标题文字...','This is the headline that is above the order button...'=>'这是订单按钮上方的标题...','This is the host title, you can use the webinar settings, or use custom host title...'=>'这是主持人的标题，你可以使用网络研讨会的设置，或使用自定义的主持人标题...','This is the image for the person hosting the webinar, this is shown under the optin area... <b>best results: 100px wide and  100px high</b>'=>'这是主持网络研讨会的人的图像，这显示在选择区下面...<b>最好的结果。100px宽，100px高</b>。','This is the image that is repeated horiztonally in the background of the banner area... If you leave this blank, it will just show the banner BG color... <br><br><b>best results:</b> 89px high..'=>'这是在横幅区域的背景中水平重复的图像......。如果你把它留空，它将只显示横幅的BG颜色...<br><br><b>最好的结果：</b>89px高...','This is the image that is repeated horiztonally in the background of the banner area... If you leave this blank, it will just show the banner BG color... For the best results, use: 89px high..'=>'这是在横幅区域的背景中水平重复的图像......。如果你把它留空，它将只显示横幅的BG颜色...为了达到最佳效果，请使用。89px高...','This is the image that is used with the social shares, for best results, keep it: 120px by 120px..'=>'这是用于社交分享的图片，为了达到最佳效果，请保持：120px x 120px。','This is the image that will be shown in the main cta area, this image will be resized to fit the area: <strong>500px width and 281px height</strong>...'=>'这是将显示在主cta区域的图片，这个图片将被调整大小以适应该区域。<b>500px宽度和281px高度</b>...','This is the image will be shown on WebinarIgnition Grid.'=>'这就是将显示在WebinarIgnition网格上的图像。','This is the main headline for the TXT reminder area...'=>'这是TXT提醒区的主要标题...','This is the main sales copy that is shown under the CTA area and sales headline. This is where you can explain all the finer details about the webinar...'=>'这是在CTA区域和销售标题下显示的主要销售副本。在这里你可以解释关于网络研讨会的所有细节。','This Is The Message Heading'=>'这就是信息标题','This is the META Description'=>'这就是META描述','This is the META Site Title'=>'这是META网站标题','This is the mini countdown area that displays in the ticket area...'=>'这是显示在门票区的迷你倒计时区域...','This is the name that the emails will be from'=>'这是电子邮件的名称，将来自于','This is the new webinar live URL webinar - only paid members should know this URL...'=>'这是新的网络研讨会直播网址网络研讨会 - 只有付费会员应该知道这个网址...','This is the number of minutes after which user will be locked out.'=>'这是用户被锁定后的分钟数。','This is the own chosen secret code used to verify that people returning from a successful payment are presented the webinar.<br/><strong>Do not edit this code after people started paying for your webinar, or they won\'t be able to access your webinar anymore!</strong>'=>'这是自己选择的秘密代码，用于验证成功付款后返回的人是否参加了网络研讨会。<br/><strong>在人们开始为你的网络研讨会付款后，不要编辑这个代码，否则他们将无法再进入你的网络研讨会！</strong>。','This is the page people will see if they go to the webinar page if it is not yet live...'=>'如果网络研讨会还没有开始，人们进入网络研讨会页面后会看到这个页面...','This is the placeholder copy for the email field on the Q / A system...'=>'这是Q/A系统中电子邮件字段的占位符副本...','This is the placeholder copy for the name field on the Q / A system...'=>'这是Q/A系统上的名称字段的占位符副本...','This is the placeholder copy for the question field on the Q / A system...'=>'这是Q/A系统上问题栏的占位符副本...','This is the placeholder text for the form they enter in their phone number...'=>'这是他们在表格中输入电话号码的占位符文本...','This is the preview text'=>'这是预览文本','This is the sender ("From") email address. NB: If you choose to use an SMTP server to send your email, your sending address will be defined by the SMTP settings of your server.'=>'这是发件人（"发件人"）的电子邮件地址。注意：如果你选择使用SMTP服务器来发送你的邮件，你的发送地址将由你的服务器的SMTP设置来定义。','This is the sign up email subject line...'=>'这是注册电子邮件的主题行...','This is the spam notice that is shown under the optin area... Helps a lot for conversion rates...'=>'这是显示在选择区域下的垃圾邮件通知...对转换率有很大帮助...','This is the sub title that is shown UNDER the webinar url form field...'=>'这是显示在网络研讨会网址表栏下的副标题...','This is the subject line for notifications sent to support staff'=>'这是发送给支持人员的通知的主题行','This is the text for the date text (for translating), leave blank if you don\'t need to translate this...'=>'这是日期文本的文字（用于翻译），如果你不需要翻译这个，请留空...','This is the text for the Host text (for translating), leave blank if you don\'t need to translate this...'=>'这是主持人的文本（用于翻译），如果不需要翻译这个，请留空...','This is the text for the time text (for translating), leave blank if you don\'t need to translate this...'=>'这是时间文本的文字（用于翻译），如果不需要翻译这个，请留空...','This is the text for the Webinar text (for translating), leave blank if you don\'t need to translate this...'=>'这是网络研讨会的文本（用于翻译），如果你不需要翻译这个，请留空...','This is the text shown in the email header.'=>'这是在电子邮件标题中显示的文本。','This is the text that is show on the right side of the webinars host photo. This should tell the visitor who the host is and why they should listen them...(html allowed ie. <b>bold tags</b>)'=>'这是显示在网络研讨会主持人照片右侧的文字。这应该告诉访问者谁是主持人，以及为什么他们应该听他们的......（允许使用html，即<b>bold tags</b>）。','This is the text that is shown above the video as it loads...'=>'这是视频加载时显示在上面的文字...','This is the text that is shown if they want to watch the replay...'=>'这是显示的文字，如果他们想看回放的话......。','This is the text that is shown on the Facebook Connect sign up button...'=>'这是显示在Facebook Connect注册按钮上的文字...','This is the text that is shown on the optin button...'=>'这是在选择按钮上显示的文字...','This is the the title for the webinar URL which appears above the webinar URL form field...'=>'这是网络研讨会URL的标题，出现在网络研讨会URL表格字段上方...','This is the time in seconds you want the button to appear...'=>'这是你希望按钮出现的时间（秒）...','This is the time that the will be sent out on the date (above)...'=>'这是将在日期（以上）发出的时间...','This is the time when the replay ends, <b>MUST BE IN 24 TIME, ie:  12:00 or 17:30</b>'=>'这是重播结束的时间，<b>必须是24小时的时间，即：12:00或17:30</b>。','This is the time, you can use the webinar settings, or use custom time...'=>'这是时间，你可以使用网络研讨会的设置，或使用自定义时间...','This is the title for the give away block...'=>'这是赠送区块的标题......','This is the txt message that is sent out, shortcode with {LINK} for the URL, but we suggest you creating a tinyURL...'=>'这是发出的txt信息，短码与{LINK}的URL，但我们建议你创建一个tinyURL...','This is the URL for the banner image you want to be shown. By defualt it is placed in the middle, perfect for a logo... <br><br><b>best results:</b> 89px high and 960px wide...'=>'这是你想显示的横幅图片的URL。默认情况下，它被放置在中间，非常适合作为一个标志...<br><br><b>最好的结果：</b>89px高，960px宽...','This is the url for your custom optin button, for best results, it should be 327px wide...'=>'这是你的自定义选择按钮的网址，为了达到最佳效果，它应该是327px宽。','This is the URL for your evergreen webinar you can share with your audience.'=>'这是你的常青网络研讨会的URL，你可以与你的观众分享。','This is the URL for your live webinar you can share with your audience.'=>'这是你可以与你的听众分享的现场网络研讨会的URL。','This is the URL for your payment page, check out page for PayPal'=>'这是你的支付页面的URL，PayPal的结帐页面','This is the URL for your payment page, check out page for Paypal, 1shoppingcart, etc...'=>'这是你的支付页面的URL，Paypal、1shoppingcart等的结账页面。','This is the URL for your payment page, check out page for WooCommerce'=>'这是你的支付页面的URL，WooCommerce的结账页面','This is the url that you take people who purchased the webinar so they can sign up...'=>'这是你把购买网络研讨会的人带到的网址，这样他们就可以注册了。','This is the url the button goes to (leave blank if you don\'t want the button to appear)...'=>'这是该按钮所指向的网址（如果你不希望该按钮出现，请留空）...','This is the URL where the order button will go...'=>'这是订单按钮将进入的URL...','This is the url where your webinar will be viewable... This is only if you want to use your own webinar page with another service...'=>'这是您的网络研讨会可以查看的网址...这只是当你想在其他服务中使用你自己的网络研讨会页面时...','This is the URL you want them to go to when the webinar is over...'=>'这是你希望他们在网络研讨会结束后前往的URL...','