en a simple order button or custom HTML...'=>'你可以选择一个简单的订单按钮或自定义HTML...','You can choose between our optin button or your own custom image optin button...'=>'你可以选择我们的选择按钮或你自己的自定义图像选择按钮...','You can choose between the styles below. This is for the webinar page and replay page...'=>'你可以选择下面的样式。这是为网络研讨会页面和回放页面准备的...','You can choose between the styles on the right. This is for the landing page/registration page and for the thank you page styles...'=>'你可以在右边的样式中进行选择。这是针对登陆页/注册页和感谢页的样式...','You can choose the question notification to be sent as soon as the webinar has ended.'=>'您可以选择在网络研讨会结束后立即发送问题通知。','You can choose the question notification to be sent immediately after the first question.'=>'你可以选择在第一个问题之后立即发送问题通知。','You can choose to add another host. Doing so will create a new WordPress user with the same privileges as the main host.'=>'你可以选择添加另一个主机。这样做将创建一个新的Wordpress用户，其权限与主主机相同。','You can choose to add another support staff member. Doing so will create a new WordPress user.'=>'你可以选择添加另一个支持人员。这样做将创建一个新的Wordpress用户。','You can choose to add multiple hosts.'=>'你可以选择添加多个主机。','You can choose to display a video embed code or have an image to be shown here. A video will get higher results...'=>'你可以选择显示一个视频嵌入代码或有一个图像显示在这里。视频将获得更高的结果...','You can choose to have more than one host'=>'你可以选择有一个以上的主机','You can choose to have support to answer questions on your behalf'=>'你可以选择让支持人员代表你回答问题','You can choose to keep default WebinarIgnition confirmation page, or redirect users to a custom URL.'=>'您可以选择保留默认的WebinarIgnition确认页面，或者将用户重定向到一个自定义的URL。','You can choose to lock out/redirect latecomers'=>'你可以选择锁定/重选迟到者','You can choose to receive an email notification whenever someone registers.'=>'你可以选择在有人注册时收到电子邮件通知。','You can choose to requeue this notification if it has been sent already.'=>'如果该通知已被发送，你可以选择重新发出该通知。','You can choose to send the questions notifications to the webinar host (in addition to support staff).'=>'您可以选择将问题通知发送给网络研讨会主持人（除支持人员外）。','You can choose to show or hide the webinar host info block...'=>'你可以选择显示或隐藏网络研讨会主持人信息块...','You can choose to show the countdown timer or hide it on your replay page...'=>'你可以选择在你的回放页面上显示倒计时器或隐藏它...','You can choose to show this day as a possible day for the webinar, it will select the next possible occurrence within the week...'=>'你可以选择显示这一天作为网络研讨会的可能日期，它将选择一周内的下一个可能发生的日期...','You can choose to use the Facebook connect button, by default its not shown, and if you do enable it, you must setup the FB connect settings in order for it to work...'=>'你可以选择使用Facebook连接按钮，默认情况下，它不显示，如果你启用它，你必须设置FB连接设置，以便它能够工作。','You can choose to use the new template options. NB: Using the new templates on old webinars may break your html, so be careful.'=>'你可以选择使用新的模板选项。注意：在旧的网络研讨会上使用新模板可能会破坏你的HTML，所以要小心。','You can choose users who will receive email notifications.'=>'你可以选择将收到电子邮件通知的用户。','You can choose whether to redirect latecomers to a URL or to the Registration page.'=>'你可以选择是否将迟到者重定向到一个URL或注册页面。','You can create a Live Webinar, Auto Webinar, OR Clone a Webinar...'=>'您可以创建一个实时网络研讨会，自动网络研讨会，或克隆网络研讨会...','You can disable default shortcodes styles if you want to style all elements by your own.'=>'如果你想用自己的方式来设计所有的元素，你可以禁用默认的短代码样式。','You can download this awesome report made you...'=>'你可以下载这份令人敬畏的报告，让你...','You can edit the copy displayed under the FB connect button...'=>'你可以编辑显示在FB连接按钮下的副本...','You can edit what the webinar info block says, if you want to translate it...'=>'你可以编辑网络研讨会信息块的内容，如果你想翻译它...','You can either choose from our built-in Email Q&A (answers will be sent to attendee via email) or Chat Q&A System (answers will be sent to attendee immediately in chat window, additionally can be sent via email), or use a 3rd party service...'=>'您可以选择我们内置的电子邮件问答（答案将通过电子邮件发送给与会者）或聊天问答系统（答案将在聊天窗口立即发送给与会者，另外还可以通过电子邮件发送），或者使用第三方服务...','You can either choose from our built-in simple Q/A System, or use a 3rd party service...'=>'你可以选择我们内置的简单Q/A系统，或使用第三方服务...','You can either link to the landing page in this funnel or a custom URL'=>'你可以链接到这个漏斗中的着陆页或一个自定义的URL。','You can either show the registration button, or you can hide it.'=>'你可以显示注册按钮，也可以隐藏它。','You can enable or disable the social share links.'=>'你可以启用或停用社会分享链接。','You can have a repeating image to be shown as the background to add some flare to your landing page...'=>'你可以有一个重复的图像作为背景显示，为你的登陆页面添加一些亮点。','You can have a repeating image to be shown as the background to add some flare to your webinar page...'=>'你可以有一个重复的图像作为背景显示，为你的网络研讨会页面添加一些亮点。','You can have them redirect to any URL you want after the video is done playing...'=>'你可以让它们在视频播放完毕后重定向到你想要的任何URL...','You can have this notification sent out or not...'=>'你可以让这个通知发出或不发出...','You can hide or show the call in number if you have a number for viewers to call in and ask questions... '=>'如果你有一个供观众打电话提问的号码，你可以隐藏或显示来电号码。','You can hide or show the free give away block on the webinar page...'=>'你可以隐藏或显示网络研讨会页面上的免费赠送块...','You can join the webinar on mobile, tablet or desktop.'=>'你可以在手机、平板电脑或桌面上参加网络研讨会。','You can modify default Advanced Iframe shortcode settings by pasting the shortcode with your own settings here.'=>'您可以在此处粘贴带有自己设置的简码，以修改默认的高级 Iframe 简码设置。','You can optionally show this text on your WebinarIgnition pages and emails. Useful for affiliate marketing.'=>'您可以选择在您的WebinarIgnition页面和电子邮件中显示此文本。对联盟营销很有用。','You can optionally show WebinarIgnition\'s logo in your email footer as part of the branding'=>'您可以选择在您的电子邮件页脚显示WebinarIgnition的标志，作为品牌宣传的一部分。','You can show footer styling for just this webinar, or use global settings for all webinars. To configure the global footer, go to'=>'你可以只为这个网络研讨会显示页脚样式，或对所有网络研讨会使用全局设置。要配置全局页脚，请进入','You can show footer styling for just this webinar, or use global settings for all webinars. To configure the global footer, go to '=>'你可以只为这个网络研讨会显示页脚样式，或对所有网络研讨会使用全局设置。要配置全局页脚，请进入','You can switch between iframe embed, or direct video source from Amazon S3, etc'=>'你可以在iframe嵌入，或直接从Amazon S3的视频源中切换，等等。','You can turn on or off the Facebook like area...'=>'你可以打开或关闭Facebook的喜欢区...','You can turn on or off the LinkedIn like area...'=>'你可以打开或关闭LinkedIn这样的区域...','You can turn on or off the Twiter like area...'=>'你可以打开或关闭类似Twiter的区域...','You can use Google caland Outlook cal reminder separately using shortcodes below'=>'你可以使用下面的简码分别使用Google caland Outlook cal提醒。','You cannot change the status of this page, as it is used for one of your webinars. You need to delete the webinar first.'=>'您不能更改此页面的状态，只要它用于您的某个网络研讨会，您就需要先删除网络研讨会。','You do not have permissions to access this page.'=>'您没有访问此页面的权限。','You have availed %s view time. Webinar is closed for you.'=>'您已经使用了 %s 分钟的浏览时间。网络研讨会对您来说已经结束。','You have new support questions for webinar '=>'您对网络研讨会有新的支持问题','You may disable Webinarignition SMTP settings if you prefer to use WordPress\'s default settings or settings from an SMTP plugin (like <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-mail-smtp/" target="_blank">WP Mail SMTP</a>).'=>'如果您喜欢使用Wordpress的默认设置或SMTP插件（如<a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-mail-smtp/" target="_blank">WP Mail SMTP</a>）的设置，您可以禁用Webinarignition SMTP设置。','You need to have the correct privileges to access this page.'=>'你需要有正确的权限来访问这个页面。','You received this message to test WebinarIgnition SMS integration.'=>'您收到这条信息是为了测试WebinarIgnition的SMS集成。','You will be connected to video via your browser using your computer, tablet, or mobile phone\'s microphone and speakers. A headset is recommended.'=>'你将通过浏览器使用你的电脑、平板电脑或手机的麦克风和扬声器连接到视频。建议使用耳机。','You will be redirected to registration page shortly.'=>'你很快就会被转到注册页面。','You will need to make sure you setup the FB Connect info, it is editable at the bottom of this page...'=>'你需要确保你设置了FB连接信息，它可以在本页面底部编辑...','You\'re answering this question...'=>'你在回答这个问题时...','Your Affiliate Link'=>'您的联盟链接','Your affiliate link should be to freemius!'=>'你的链接应该是freemius!','Your Amazing sales copy for your webinar would show up here...'=>'你的网络研讨会的惊人销售副本将显示在这里...','Your Answer'=>'您的答案','Your answer was successfully sent'=>'您的答案已成功发送','Your Awesome Free Gift'=>'您令人敬畏的免费礼物','Your Awesome Free Gift</h4><p>You can download this awesome report made you...'=>'你真棒的免费礼物</h4><p>你可以下载这份很棒的报告，让你...','Your banner image size can be any height, but its best at 89px high. Also, your banner repeating graphic should be the same height...'=>'你的横幅图片大小可以是任何高度，但最好是89px高。此外，你的横幅重复图形应该是相同的高度...','Your branding copy should contain "Webinar Powered By WebinarIgnition"!'=>'您的品牌推广文案应包含 "Webinar Powered By WebinarIgnition"!','Your changes are not saved!'=>'你的修改没有被保存!','Your charge (in cents; for Stripe payment only)'=>'您的费用（美分；仅适用于Stripe支付）。','Your charge descrfiption(for Stripe payment only)'=>'您的收费说明（仅适用于Stripe支付）。','Your CTA content is not looking nicely? Then you can show your CTA contents in an Iframe, to enable this feature you need to install and activate the free "%s" plugin.'=>'您的 CTA 内容看起来不美观？要启用此功能，您需要安装并激活免费的"%s "插件。','Your Email Address'=>'您的电子邮件地址','Your footer for this email only...'=>'你的页脚仅适用于此邮件...','Your freemius affiliate link if you want to earn money from this branding. This can be used in your webinar reminder emails and in email answers to attendee questions.'=>'你的freemius联盟链接，如果你想从这个品牌推广中赚钱。这可以用在你的网络研讨会提醒邮件和回答与会者问题的邮件中。','Your Gift'=>'您的礼物','Your Host:'=>'你的主人。','Your live video setup settings here...'=>'你的现场视频设置设置在这里...','Your main banner image for the landing page...'=>'你的登陆页面的主要横幅图片...','Your Name'=>'您的姓名','Your Name Here'=>'你的名字在这里','Your plan does not allows you to use the WooCommerce checkout URL feature. If you want more, please upgrade your plan. Click <a href=\'%s\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a>!'=>'你的计划不允许你使用WooCommerce的结帐URL功能。如果你想要更多，请升级你的计划。点击<a href=\'%s\' target=\'_blank\'>这里</a>!','Your Registrants Command Center'=>'你的注册者指挥中心','Your Reply To'=>'您的回复','Your spam test email could not be sent. There seems to be a problem with your server.'=>'您的垃圾邮件测试邮件无法被发送。你的服务器似乎有问题。','Your spam test email from WebinarIgnition was successfully sent. Go back to mail-tester.com and click on \'Then check your score\' to see the results.'=>'您的来自WebinarIgnition的垃圾邮件测试邮件已成功发送。回到mail-tester.com，点击 "然后检查你的分数 "来查看结果。','Your Special Gift:'=>'你的特别礼物。','Your Timezone translation'=>'您的时区翻译','Your Webinar Title'=>'您的网络研讨会标题','Your Webinar URL'=>'您的网络研讨会网址','Your WebinarIgnition SMTP settings have been migrated. You can find the new settings <a href="/wp-admin/admin.php?page=webinarignition_settings">here</a>'=>'您的WebinarIgnition SMTP设置已经被迁移。您可以在这里找到新的设置<a href="/wp-admin/admin.php?page=webinarignition_settings"></a>。','YOUR<br/>TIMEZONE'=>'您的<br/>时区','{privacy_policy} | {imprint} | © Copyright {year} {site_title}'=>'{隐私政策｝| {版本说明｝| 版权所有{年} {网站标题｝']];
